    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16_128",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10095",
      "speaker": "mikumother",
      "text": "本当はあの人と一緒に出ていきたかったんでしょ……！ 私を置いていけばよかったじゃない！",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16_128.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "eaa89a8207f7e97d37a3bae22d88fbe18bd0e4f44a497b2e7bcb8284856383ae",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16_128.wav",
      "subtitle": "你其实想跟着那个人一起离开对吧……！\n当时把我丢下不就好了吗！",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "e41cd7752e201c3f40144f60d7bc45efea22895bed4dfb7fd17a979158f7f8f0",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_016",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02",
      "speaker": "mikumother",
      "text": "でも……この街にはつらい思い出が多すぎるでしょ。 だからいい機会だと思うの",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_016.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "8fd31250a402368a3205000ae4efb29159ac0652cb85713581472220b3b59582",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_016.wav",
      "subtitle": "但是……这个地方让你难过的事实在太多了。\n所以妈妈觉得这是个好机会",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "fb74b762cc01fe06f18eb28d66e3172e9171a266671a3ca4ca8ffad5e573e301",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_012",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02",
      "speaker": "mikumother",
      "text": "今度は大きな一軒家にも住めるし、 みくちゃんの新しい学校も見つけたの",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_012.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "e8af523600f1a2c9cfbb5c85d996a41427e66a962b30e371bcf133759d18a524",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_012.wav",
      "subtitle": "这次还能住进宽敞的独栋房子，\n妈妈也给小心玖找了新学校",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "9aab6ea6b9d3b7dc3a5eed3e020574c3b2e0a762556cc2bb9fbfbe97fdee6460",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_02-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16_133",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10095",
      "speaker": "mikumother",
      "text": "――っ、そうよ！！ 明日も明後日もずっと働かないと、食べていけないでしょ！？",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16_133.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "105b5cc315705458026d5bbaaad8d87455a075a7093670719529590e15521434",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16_133.wav",
      "subtitle": "——是啊！！\n明天也好后天也罢，不一直工作的话，哪来的饭吃！？",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "cd1abe75829f00132dab379f27004786902c93b1b3c691778ed0bf6dc76fcf42",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16_146",
      "game": "OurNotes",
      "episode": "10095",
      "speaker": "mikumother",
      "text": "すっごく素敵な人だよ。 きっとみくちゃんのいいパパになると思う",
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16/adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16_146.m4a",
      "evidence": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Episode.json.br",
      "discussion": "",
      "pcm_sha256": "5b516c9bab7475b2f0dc8c813f1a341fa87adb567ed934c725139816df8ba645",
      "path": "assets/voices/curated_adv_voice_kadan_005_1_16_146.wav",
      "subtitle": "是个非常棒的人哦。\n我想他一定会成为小心玖的好爸爸",
      "personality": null,
      "source_sha256": "9800413e21aab33bca514b735e75bef1d47ce72aa050639ae44a31da742501ab",
      "subtitleSource": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ci-ke/story-assets-bdon/3ba846a1360a82782ff6a30dd64d9744f4886b6a/assets/bdon-en-assets/Adv/Episode/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Text/adv_script_kadan_005_1_16-Text.json.br"
    },
    {
      "cue": "adv_voice_kadan_005_1_02_011",
